From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:52:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Audit every pending-custody mutation site before capture
 certification

Adds a static inventory of all outbox/parent-envelope insert, update and delete
sites with a gate test that fails on any unaudited, stale or reclassified site.
Certifies nothing, stamps nothing, activates nothing (spec section 8).
---
